@startuml
skinparam style strict
hide footbox

actor "FE (User App)" as FE
participant "BFF (Our System)" as BFF
box "INPS Services (PDND)" #LightBlue
  participant "MS INPS\n(GestioneDomandaCED)" as INPS
end box

title 5. Read-Only Operations (Proxy to INPS)

FE -> BFF: GET /summary or /receipt or /details or /draft (idLavorazione)
note right of FE: Authorization: Bearer <opaque_token>

BFF -> BFF: Verify ownership: \nCheck if idLavorazione belongs to UserSession.CF
BFF -> INPS: RichiediRiepilogo / RichiediRicevuta / RichiediStato / RecuperoDatiDomanda(idLavorazione, CF)

alt INPS Success (HTTP 200)
    INPS --> BFF: Response Data (JSON or Base64 PDF)
    BFF --> FE: 200 OK (Response Data)
else INPS Document not ready (800 summary / 801 receipt)
    INPS --> BFF: Error Code 800/801
    BFF --> FE: 409 Not ready yet (retry later)
else INPS Failure
    INPS --> BFF: Error Response
    BFF --> FE: Error Details
end
@enduml
